  "title": "Head office network",
  "description": "Physical and logical network of the head office, top to bottom from the Internet. Traffic enters through the edge router and a firewall pair. The firewall publishes a reverse proxy (443) and a mail gateway (25) in the DMZ and passes internal traffic to the core switch. The internal LAN has two VLANs: a server VLAN with application servers, a database cluster and backup storage that receives nightly copies, and an office VLAN where an access switch serves workstations and the Wi-Fi access points used by laptops.",
